  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F).",
    "Soak 12 wooden skewers in water for 30 minutes.",
    "Cut the cod fillets into 1-inch pieces.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together shio-cure, garlic, and black pepper.",
    "Add the cod pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with shio-cure mixture.",
    "Thread the coated cod pieces onto the wooden skewers.",
    "Brush the sesame seed oil onto the grill grates.",
    "Grill the skewers for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, mix together chimichurri sauce and lime juice in a small bowl.",
    "Serve the grilled cod skewers with chimichurri sauce spooned over the top."
